<mxfile host="65bd71144e">
    <diagram id="hoMaCAKbzPVspGHy5ryI" name="Page-1">
        <mxGraphModel dx="6683" dy="4993" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User as :User (B2C/B2B)\n    participant WebAPI as :WebAPI (Controllers)\n    participant App as :Application (Services)\n    participant Infra as :Infrastructure (EF Core)\n    participant DB as :PostgreSQL (Docker)\n\n    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)\n    Note over User, DB: 1. FLUXO DE LOGIN E EMISSÃO DE JWT (KAN-4)\n    User-&gt;&gt;WebAPI: POST /api/auth/login (LoginUserDto)\n    activate WebAPI\n    WebAPI-&gt;&gt;App: Login(dto)\n    activate App\n    \n    App-&gt;&gt;Infra: Busca usuário por Email\n    activate Infra\n    Infra-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT * FROM Users WHERE Email = ...\n    activate DB\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Infra: Retorna User (PasswordHash, AccountType)\n    deactivate DB\n    Infra--&gt;&gt;App: Retorna Entidade User\n    deactivate Infra\n\n    Note over App: Validação BCrypt e Geração de JWT\n    alt Senha Incorreta ou Usuário Nulo\n        App--&gt;&gt;WebAPI: Lança Exceção (Credenciais inválidas)\n        WebAPI--&gt;&gt;User: Retorna Erro 401 Unauthorized\n    else Senha Válida\n        Note over App: Gera Token JWT com Claims (Id, Email, TipoConta)\n        App--&gt;&gt;WebAPI: Retorna Token String\n        WebAPI--&gt;&gt;User: Retorna 200 OK { token: \&quot;eyJ...\&quot; }\n    end\n    deactivate App\n    deactivate WebAPI\n    end\n\n    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)\n    Note over User, DB: 2. FLUXO DE ACESSO A FÓRUM TERAPÊUTICO (Existente)\n    User-&gt;&gt;WebAPI: Solicita acesso a fórum terapêutico (GET /api/forums/{id})\n    activate WebAPI\n    WebAPI-&gt;&gt;App: ValidarAcesso(userId, forumId)\n    activate App\n\n    App-&gt;&gt;Infra: Solicita dados do usuário e do fórum\n    activate Infra\n    Infra-&gt;&gt;DB: Executa SELECT\n    activate DB\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Infra: Retorna DataNascimento, StatusLaudo e Regras do Fórum\n    deactivate DB\n    Infra--&gt;&gt;App: Retorna Entidades populadas\n    deactivate Infra\n\n    Note over App: Validação de Regras de Negócio (RN01 e RN03)\n\n    alt Idade &lt; Exigida OU Laudo != Verificado\n        App--&gt;&gt;WebAPI: Lança Exceção de Acesso Negado\n        WebAPI--&gt;&gt;User: Retorna Erro 403 Forbidden\n    else Regras Cumpridas (Sucesso)\n        Note over App: Aplica RN06 (Máscara de Trigger Warnings nos posts)\n        App--&gt;&gt;WebAPI: Retorna DTO do Fórum e Posts tratados\n        WebAPI--&gt;&gt;User: Retorna 200 OK + Conteúdo acessível\n    end\n\n    deactivate App\n    deactivate WebAPI\n    end&quot;&#xa;}" id="4">
                    <mxCell style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=1;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                        <mxGeometry x="-2360" y="-1410" width="1892.5" height="1809" as="geometry"/>
                    </mxCell>
                </UserObject>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
</mxfile>